  m_Name: Event_StardustFog
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: AyeAye.Runtime::AyeAye.DayDefinition
  eventId: StardustFog
  title: "S\u01AF\u01A0NG B\u1EE4I SAO"
  briefingText: "S\u01AF\u01A0NG B\u1EE4I SAO\n\nT\xE0u \u0111i v\xE0o m\u1ED9t d\u1EA3i
    b\u1EE5i sao m\u1ECFng. K\xEDnh quan s\xE1t m\u1EDD d\u1EA7n, nh\u01B0ng c\u1EA3m
    bi\u1EBFn v\u1EABn b\xE1o \"R\xD5 R\xC0NG\". B\u1EE5i b\xE1m d\xE0y \u1EDF m\u1EB7t
    tr\u01B0\u1EDBc t\xE0u, kh\xF4ng l\u1ECDt v\xE0o khoang k\xEDn.\n\nM\u1EE4C TI\xCAU
    H\xD4M NAY: v\u01B0\u1EE3t d\u1EA3i b\u1EE5i sao m\xE0 kh\xF4ng tr\u1EC5."
  statusText: "T\xC0U: k\xEDnh m\u1EDD, c\u1EA3m bi\u1EBFn t\u1ED1t.\nB\xC1NH: {CARGO}.\nC\u1EA2M
    BI\u1EBEN: \"KH\xD4NG KH\xCD KHU V\u1EF0C: R\xD5 R\xC0NG\" (k\xEDnh quan s\xE1t:
    m\u1EDD)\n\nMIRA: \"C\u1EA3m bi\u1EBFn b\xE1o r\xF5 r\xE0ng. K\xEDnh m\u1EDD
    l\xE0 chuy\u1EC7n nh\u1ECF.\"\nBOB: \"C\xF3 g\xEC \u0111\xF3 d\xEDnh \u1EDF m\u1EB7t
    tr\u01B0\u1EDBc!\"\nDEX: \"'R\xF5 r\xE0ng' theo c\xE1ch n\xF3i c\u1EE7a ai? K\xEDnh
    m\u1EDD c\xF2n d\xE1m n\xF3i r\xF5 r\xE0ng?\"\nCHEN: \"V\u1EC7t b\u1EE5i \u0111\xF3
    \u0111\u1EC3 mai qu\xE9t.\""
